# ─── Private / sensitive ─────────────────────────────────────────
# CRITICAL: never commit private payloads, secrets, run results or
# disclosure-cycle artefacts. They are kept outside this repository
# and MUST NOT appear here.

# Private payload YAMLs (per-vector full_payload + reproducer +
# internal_breakdown_justification; vendor disclosure prep material).
# The PUBLIC catalog (taxonomy + signature only) lives in
# core/src/airi/vectors.rs and is intentionally committed.
core/airi-private-payloads/
**/airi-private-payloads/

# Disclosure packets (vendor-bound, embargoed).
disclosure-packets/
**/disclosure-packets/

# Harness run CSV outputs (vendor + per-run sensitive identifiers).
scripts/airi/results/
**/airi/results/

# Secrets / credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.asc
secrets/
credentials/

# ─── Rust ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
# (Cargo.lock is gitignored for library crates; commit if this becomes
# a binary-only workspace.)

# ─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# ─── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*~

# ─── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
*.log

# ─── AIRI-specific ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local notes / draft files we may keep alongside the repo but not commit
docs/notes/
docs/Brainstorm/private/
NOTES.local.md
TODO.local.md
